1
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:45,540
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:46,950
[Episode 28]

3
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:47,400
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:48,960
Sis.

6
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:49,920
You know—

7
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:51,770
it's not about work.

8
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:54,620
I don't want to go back to Senzhou.

9
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:58,880
Actually,

10
00:00:59,390 --> 00:01:00,840
after you left,

11
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,770
we took on some Zhuoyuan cases too.

12
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:04,879
He often asked about you.

13
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:05,680
But see—

14
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:07,680
I didn't even know where you'd gone.

15
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:10,380
Some things should just be
let go when it's time.

16
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,360
You probably know, right?

17
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:14,560
Mr. Zhuo's father—

18
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:15,960
passed away 3 months ago.

19
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:18,810
I heard about it.

20
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:21,280
It hit him hard.

21
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:23,320
I've never seen

22
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:24,320
anyone like that.

23
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:26,840
It feels like his soul’s been drained
right out of him.

24
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:28,320
The last time he was like that

25
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,680
was because you left.

26
00:01:30,530 --> 00:01:32,200
He went crazy—

27
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:34,650
and turned the whole Senzhou upside down.

28
00:01:35,039 --> 00:01:36,840
After that, he never recovered.

29
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,440
His company

30
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,720
also stalled.

31
00:01:46,050 --> 00:01:47,880
I happen to have an appointment
with Mr. Zhuo.

32
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:48,910
He'll be here soon.

33
00:01:48,910 --> 00:01:49,570
You...

34
00:01:49,759 --> 00:01:51,400
Want to wait with me?

35
00:01:52,789 --> 00:01:53,720
Sis.

36
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:55,850
I want to ask you a favor.

37
00:01:57,759 --> 00:01:58,640
No matter what,

38
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,000
don't let him know

39
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,480
I came to see you.

40
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,480
Okay.

41
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:08,220
But you need to understand one thing—

42
00:02:08,699 --> 00:02:09,960
some people and things

43
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:11,240
can't be avoided.

44
00:02:33,270 --> 00:02:36,970
♪ A meteor streaks
across the promises of the past ♪

45
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:39,640
♪ Memories wither at a touch ♪

46
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:42,530
♪ Seasons keep changing ♪

47
00:02:42,790 --> 00:02:47,040
♪ I still remember your palm ♪

48
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:50,920
♪ Time has passed ♪

49
00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:55,380
♪ The unexpectedly regret came to me ♪

50
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:58,070
♪ The warmth ♪

51
00:02:58,140 --> 00:03:01,700
♪ is still in my mind ♪

52
00:03:02,980 --> 00:03:06,460
♪ At that time, happiness was too easy ♪

53
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:09,050
♪ We knew best how to waste it all ♪

54
00:03:09,930 --> 00:03:12,030
♪ Before we learned to cherish it ♪

55
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:14,710
♪ We let each other slip away ♪

56
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:17,329
♪ The last time ♪

57
00:03:17,450 --> 00:03:21,030
♪ I walked with you around some corner ♪

58
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:24,540
♪ A hug replaced all the outcomes ♪

59
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:26,670
♪ We both once had it all ♪

60
00:03:26,930 --> 00:03:28,220
♪ This time we drifted apart ♪

61
00:03:28,690 --> 00:03:31,260
♪ Just don't forget me ♪

62
00:03:31,490 --> 00:03:34,970
♪ The wind blew you and me apart ♪

63
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:38,920
♪ We once ran, cried,
and laughed together ♪

64
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,400
♪ Walked all the way through
every twist and turn ♪

65
00:03:42,530 --> 00:03:46,320
♪ Yet still missed each other
just as happiness drew near ♪

66
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,930
♪ Only after knowing what it is to lose ♪

67
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:49,770
♪ And never being able to touch again ♪

68
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:53,590
♪ Can we truly understand
what it means to have ♪

69
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,910
♪ We loved ♪

70
00:03:56,380 --> 00:04:01,270
♪ Scattered and frozen
beneath the starry sky ♪

71
00:04:09,330 --> 00:04:12,850
♪ At that time, happiness was too easy ♪

72
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:15,440
♪ We knew best how to waste it all ♪

73
00:04:16,260 --> 00:04:18,470
♪ Before we learned to cherish it ♪

74
00:04:18,610 --> 00:04:21,120
♪ We let each other slip away ♪

75
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:23,690
♪ The last time ♪

76
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,480
Shu Tinglan!

77
00:04:23,790 --> 00:04:27,370
♪ I walked with you around some corner ♪

78
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:30,970
♪ A hug replaced all the outcomes ♪

79
00:04:30,850 --> 00:04:31,520
Sorry

80
00:04:31,070 --> 00:04:33,030
♪ We both once had it all ♪

81
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:34,670
♪ This time we drifted apart ♪

82
00:04:35,010 --> 00:04:37,740
♪ Just don't forget me ♪

83
00:04:38,060 --> 00:04:41,420
♪ The wind blew you and me apart ♪

84
00:04:41,580 --> 00:04:45,400
♪ We once ran, cried,
and laughed together ♪

85
00:04:45,570 --> 00:04:48,860
♪ Walked all the way through
every twist and turn ♪

86
00:04:48,990 --> 00:04:52,740
♪ Yet still missed each other
just as happiness drew near ♪

87
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:54,400
♪ Only after knowing what it is to lose ♪

88
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,240
♪ And never being able to touch again ♪

89
00:04:54,909 --> 00:04:55,800
Mom

90
00:04:56,320 --> 00:05:00,160
♪ Can we truly understand
what it means to have ♪

91
00:04:58,500 --> 00:04:59,960
I've come to see you again.

92
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:02,260
♪ We loved ♪

93
00:05:02,810 --> 00:05:07,970
♪ Scattered and frozen
beneath the starry sky ♪

94
00:05:23,970 --> 00:05:27,320
♪ The wind blew you and me apart ♪

95
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:31,510
♪ We once ran, cried,
and laughed together ♪

96
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:34,930
♪ Walked all the way through
every twist and turn ♪

97
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:43,409
I'm telling you, Yu'an—

98
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:45,120
do you have to be like this?

99
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:47,540
Calling me out for drinks every few days,

100
00:05:47,690 --> 00:05:49,290
not even changing the place—

101
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:51,170
you insist on this restaurant.

102
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:57,920
Because from here, I can see

103
00:05:58,010 --> 00:05:59,760
Shu Tinglan's home.

104
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:05,480
This is her favorite—

105
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:07,400
grilled oysters.

106
00:06:09,330 --> 00:06:10,280
I'm telling you,

107
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:11,720
Yu'an—

108
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,180
do you have to be like this?

109
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,840
You're divorced, not widowed.

110
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,040
We—

111
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,840
didn't divorce.

112
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:22,400
Fine.

113
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:23,970
You didn't divorce.

114
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,730
Shu Tinglan is out there living well

115
00:06:26,730 --> 00:06:28,060
where you can't see her,

116
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:31,080
while you're here writing a memoir
for a dead wife.

117
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:36,360
I saw her

118
00:06:37,830 --> 00:06:38,760
yesterday.

119
00:06:39,159 --> 00:06:40,290
In your dream again?

120
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,200
Downstairs from her law firm.

121
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,080
Fine.

122
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:46,960
You saw her.

123
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:48,040
So what?

124
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:52,000
Didn't catch up to her again.

125
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:56,480
Let me say a few more things—

126
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,880
don't mind me nagging.

127
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,480
Instead of overthinking,

128
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:02,650
why don't you deal with
the company's affairs?

129
00:07:02,650 --> 00:07:03,720
Ruixin's products

130
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:06,000
are hitting the market one after another.

131
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,320
Look at Zhuoyuan—

132
00:07:08,250 --> 00:07:09,760
technology isn't advancing,

133
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:11,760
and there's no sign of new products.

134
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:14,200
I know.

135
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,630
First Shu Tinglan left without
saying goodbye,

136
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:18,400
then your dad passed away.

137
00:07:18,830 --> 00:07:20,230
You may be struggling and

138
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,690
under a lot of pressure,

139
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:25,090
but you can't lose sight of what
you're responsible for.

140
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,880
If I were you,

141
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,540
so what if I couldn't find my ex-wife?

142
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,960
I'd make my business bigger and stronger,

143
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,400
reach every corner of the globe—

144
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:36,560
ads everywhere for my products—

145
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:39,320
so wherever she goes, she thinks of me.

146
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:42,560
If you disappear like this
for a few more years,

147
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,720
who'll even remember who you are?

148
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,060
How about this—

149
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:54,180
my friend's company is
sponsoring an event.

150
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,980
I'll make the call for you.

151
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:56,880
In a few days,

152
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:58,080
you go.

153
00:07:58,060 --> 00:08:01,290
[The 3rd National Youth Robotics
Competition, Hua'an Division]

154
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,980
Show your face.

155
00:08:00,110 --> 00:08:01,120
At least

156
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:03,200
don't let the industry forget you.

157
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:28,630
[The 3rd National Youth Robotics
Competition, Hua'an Division]

158
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:33,080
Don't worry, Xiao He.

159
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:34,760
Mom promises.

160
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:36,600
I'll keep my word.

161
00:08:37,090 --> 00:08:38,400
Tomorrow, definitely—

162
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,130
I won't miss your competition.

163
00:08:46,610 --> 00:08:47,290
Here she comes.

164
00:08:47,290 --> 00:08:48,200
Lawyer Shu.

165
00:08:49,830 --> 00:08:51,560
You said you have new evidence.

166
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:01,290
Hello, friends from the media.

167
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,640
Today, on behalf of Ruixin Technology,

168
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,160
I proudly present

169
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:06,880
our new smart system.

170
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:08,360
As you all know,

171
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,040
the development of intelligent AI

172
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,840
is going to be a major trend
in our country in the years ahead.

173
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:15,100
So, after more than a thousand rounds
of internal testing—

174
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,800
The reason I was rejected
in the first trial

175
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:17,840
was that our developed content

176
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,460
wasn't directly reflected in
the opposing party's product.

177
00:09:19,460 --> 00:09:21,040
But the concepts mentioned in this video

178
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,600
are highly similar to our project.

179
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,200
However, the main company in our case

180
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,280
isn't Ruixin.

181
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:27,210
They're all birds of a feather.

182
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,120
I have a colleague

183
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,920
who worked at Ruixin.

184
00:09:35,030 --> 00:09:36,360
These two companies

185
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:37,640
have a secret agreement—

186
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:39,840
secretly sharing related technology,

187
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,160
deliberately joining forces

188
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:41,820
to engage in

189
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,320
malicious competition.

190
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:45,520
Next time something this
important happens,

191
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:46,880
tell me immediately.

192
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:49,970
Organize the materials first
and send them to me.

193
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:51,080
Okay.

194
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:52,600
Then Lawyer Shu,

195
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:54,520
I'll organize them in the next couple
of days and send them to you.

196
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:56,360
If you don't have anything else to do,

197
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,490
I'll help you organize them together.

198
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,800
I promised my daughter

199
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:02,640
I'd definitely go back to Hua'an tomorrow.

200
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:03,160
Okay.

201
00:10:17,070 --> 00:10:18,040
Yi Muyang.

202
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,480
Where's Xiao He?

203
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,280
She's inside.

204
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:23,640
I didn't expect

205
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:24,800
this meeting to run so long.

206
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:25,600
It's fine.

207
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,760
I recorded it all for you.

208
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,120
Next,

209
00:10:33,650 --> 00:10:37,040
[The 3rd National Youth Robotics
Competition, Hua'an Division]

210
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:37,920
we announce the gold award for the youth
category of this competition.

211
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:38,880
Number 3—

212
00:10:39,110 --> 00:10:40,480
Shu Nianhe.

213
00:10:50,980 --> 00:10:52,620
[Certificate of Honor]

214
00:10:52,730 --> 00:10:54,800
[The 3rd National Youth Robotics
Competition, Hua'an Division]

215
00:10:56,650 --> 00:10:58,160
[Certificate of Honor]

216
00:11:08,430 --> 00:11:09,890
Little friend Shu Nianhe,

217
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:10,920
correct?

218
00:11:12,970 --> 00:11:15,760
Teacher, how do you know my name?

219
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,880
Because you did really well

220
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:20,080
in the competition.

221
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:20,920
Thank you.

222
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,440
I think so too.

223
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:25,490
I like your confidence.

224
00:11:27,110 --> 00:11:29,040
Where are your teacher or parents?

225
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,720
I'd like to know too.

226
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,170
She was just here—

227
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:34,840
Nianhe.

228
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:38,440
Mom!

229
00:11:41,410 --> 00:11:43,710
♪ Between us ♪

230
00:11:44,260 --> 00:11:47,030
♪ The image of us holding each other ♪

231
00:11:47,660 --> 00:11:53,100
♪ I see the dream encounter of that day ♪

232
00:11:53,450 --> 00:11:56,360
The rain outside the window stopped

233
00:11:56,690 --> 00:11:59,290
We're still here

234
00:11:59,810 --> 00:12:01,980
♪ Making wishes in the rain ♪

235
00:12:02,490 --> 00:12:07,570
♪ It's a language of understanding
that never changes ♪

236
00:12:08,170 --> 00:12:10,580
♪ By the window after the rain ♪

237
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:11,840
Mom, was I great?

238
00:12:09,870 --> 00:12:11,410
[Certificate of Honor]

239
00:12:11,070 --> 00:12:16,690
♪ Freezing time as the raindrops fall ♪

240
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:18,920
Mom!

241
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:21,760
Of course.

242
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:22,850
Baby, you're the best.

243
00:12:22,850 --> 00:12:24,120
You're Mommy's pride.

244
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:28,840
Mr. Zhuo.

245
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:30,850
Long time no see.

246
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:42,210
Our family is going to celebrate
with our kid,

247
00:12:42,380 --> 00:12:43,780
so we're heading off now.

248
00:12:53,470 --> 00:12:54,720
Yi Muyang.

249
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,490
Either you hold me tight right now,

250
00:12:56,490 --> 00:12:57,480
or you push me away.
